    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for a trace analysis run. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All parameters have sensible defaults that replicate the original hard-coded behaviour. The struct can be constructed from a JSON object whose keys follow snake_case field names (see the explicit constructor below). Any key absent from the JSON retains its default. </para>
